IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0016.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PAY0016C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 OT-PAY-AMT         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CALC-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "OT-PAY-AMT=" OT-PAY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
CALC-OVERTIME.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CU-EMP-CLASS = 'C'
            MOVE 0 TO OT-PAY-AMT
        WHEN CU-HOURS-WORKED > 50
            COMPUTE OT-PAY-AMT = CU-GRS-PAY-AMT * 0.25
        WHEN CU-HOURS-WORKED > 40
            COMPUTE OT-PAY-AMT = CU-GRS-PAY-AMT * 0.10
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.00 TO OT-PAY-AMT
    END-EVALUATE.
